# ASK AI - Educational AI Platform Context

## Project Vision

ASK AI is an AI-powered educational platform for Indian CBSE students (Classes 10-12) studying AI, CS, IT, and IP. Started as a Telegram study bot, it is evolving into a memory-enabled, multi-platform learning system with content intelligence.

**Scale:** 2,870 unique students, 14,470+ interactions, 83% returning user rate. YouTube channel: 100K subscribers, 30M+ views. Website: learnwithaakash.in

**Creator:** Aakash Singh (IIT Bombay), single developer.

## Architecture Overview

### Current State (Telegram Bot)
- **Framework:** FastAPI + python-telegram-bot v21
- **LLM:** OpenAI GPT-4o via Responses API with function-calling
- **Storage:** Google Sheets (profiles, logs, notes index, warnings) -- MIGRATING to Supabase
- **Content:** Google Drive (200+ PDFs organized by Class > Subject > Type > Topic)
- **Memory:** In-memory dict (lost on restart) -- ADDING Mem0 persistent memory
- **Tools:** get_notes, list_available_resources, search_videos, update_user_profile, web_search_preview
- **Deployment:** Google Cloud Run + Secret Manager

### Target State (Unified Platform)
- **Database:** Supabase PostgreSQL (separate project from academy-platform)
- **LLM Routing:** GPT-4o for doubts/explanations, Gemini 2.5 Flash (FREE) for notes/links/greetings
- **Embeddings:** gemini-embedding-001 (FREE, 3072 dims, MRL scalable to 768)
- **Vector Store:** Supabase pgvector
- **Memory:** Mem0 with Supabase pgvector backend
- **Document Parsing:** Gemini 2.5 Flash (FREE, up to 1000 pages, multimodal)
- **Content Sources:** Drive PDFs + YouTube transcripts + custom notes + NCERT/CBSE
- **Platforms:** Telegram (now), Website (academy-platform), Discord (future)

### Revised Technology Stack (Post-V0 Research)
- **RAG:** Gemini File Search Tool (managed RAG, FREE storage + query embeddings)
- **PDF Parsing:** IBM Docling (97.9% table accuracy, MIT, 56K stars) + PyMuPDF fallback
- **Vector Store Split:** Gemini File Search (content) + Supabase pgvector (Mem0 memory only)
- **Key Libraries:** google-genai (Gemini SDK), docling, mem0ai, fsrs (spaced repetition), youtube-transcript-api
- **Decision Log:** All changes tracked in DECISIONS.md (immutable append-only)

