## Student Data Insights (14,470 interactions analyzed)

- **Top request:** "notes" (463x). 28% of all messages are notes/PDF requests.
- **14% of responses** are "please specify class/subject" -- fixable with memory + better onboarding.
- **14% "can't find content"** -- content gaps or search failures.
- **Only 3% explanation requests** -- bot has trained students to treat it as a file server. RAG will change this.
- **Class distribution:** Class 10 (69%), Class 11 (18%), Class 12 (14%).
- **Subject:** AI (71%), CS (18%), IT (6%), IP (5%).
- **42% of registered users never set class/subject** -- broken onboarding.

